  "body": "Four bedrooms. Four bathrooms. Standalone and freehold. There's a lot more to this modern Eastern Bays home than meets the eye.\r\n\r\nIf you've been searching for a spacious, low-maintenance family home in Auckland's Eastern Bays, offering privacy, flexibility and room for different stages of life, this one deserves a closer look.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed across three split levels, connected by short half-flights of stairs, this modern four-bedroom home offers a clever balance of shared living and private spaces. Ideal for multigenerational living, families with teenagers, extended family, guests or those wanting space for flatmates, the layout gives everyone room to enjoy their own independence.\r\n\r\nHere's what makes it worth a look:\r\n\r\n*  Four bedrooms, four bathrooms plus a separate guest toilet, including two ground-floor bedrooms with their own ensuites. Ideal for teenagers, extended family, guests or those considering flatmates to help with the mortgage.\r\n\r\n*  Modern kitchen with Miele appliances, separate dining and comfortable living areas.\r\n\r\n*  A private upper-level master suite, offering a peaceful retreat away from the main living spaces.\r\n\r\n*  Flexible spaces for working from home, a home office, study or simply enjoying a little extra room.\r\n\r\n*  Standalone and freehold ownership, with no shared walls and easy-care outdoor spaces. Perfect for those seeking low-maintenance, lock-up-and-leave living.\r\n\r\n*  Internal-access garage plus off-street parking, offering everyday convenience.\r\n\r\n*  Stamford Builders Insurance guarantee for added peace of mind.\r\n\r\nAnd then there's the location. Enjoy the convenience of being close to Auckland City while having the Eastern Bays beaches, cafés, shops and recreational options within easy reach. A great balance of city convenience and coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nCurrently tenanted, this modern freehold property offers options for both owner-occupiers planning their next move and investors looking for a low-maintenance investment property in Auckland's Eastern Bays.\r\n\r\nThe developer is ready to move on to their next project, and this home is ready for its next chapter.\r\n\r\nSpace for everyone, flexibility for whatever life brings, and the Eastern Bays lifestyle right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nCome and see what's possible.\r\n\r\nOpen homes as advertised. All conjunctional agents welcome.\r\n\r\nPrivate viewings:\r\n\r\nKristy Chen | 020 4149 0233\r\nAngelina Vihrova | 021 727 751",
